  "querySets": {
    "about": "The small, rotated set of discovery queries actually run (strategy C), with a 3-day window. Google News returns nothing when an OR group is combined with another term, so each query is either a flat OR of phrases or two plain words. Sport context comes from the phrase itself and from the sports check every discovery result must pass (non-sports results are rejected as 'general-feed').",
    "israeliAngle": [
